    "body": "Instead of iterating through the diff three times, it may be simpler and more declarative to have a `GitDiff` struct that parses output a single time:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nstruct GitDiff {\r\n  added: u32,\r\n  modified: u32,\r\n  deleted: u32,\r\n}\r\n\r\nimpl GitDiff {\r\n  fn parse(diff: &str) -> Self;\r\n}\r\n\r\n```",
